WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.152
CAPSULE: Meet the PopPK and AI Methodology Atlas.

00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:07.324
CAPSULE: A focused reading queue for pharmacometrics

00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:08.911
CAPSULE: and artificial intelligence.

00:00:09.261 --> 00:00:11.634
TABLET: It searches daily. No new match?

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:14.402
TABLET: Discover an unreported paper from 2020 onward.

00:00:14.752 --> 00:00:18.386
CAPSULE: Each brief covers the problem, contribution,

00:00:18.386 --> 00:00:20.809
CAPSULE: new possibilities, and significance.

00:00:20.809 --> 00:00:23.232
CAPSULE: Interpretations use abstracts only.

00:00:23.582 --> 00:00:25.444
TABLET: Search, filter, and compare.

00:00:25.444 --> 00:00:28.702
TABLET: Relevance measures topic fit, not scientific quality.

00:00:29.052 --> 00:00:31.884
CAPSULE: Research Spotlight adds a relevant paper

00:00:31.884 --> 00:00:34.244
CAPSULE: from Science, Cell, or Nature.

00:00:34.244 --> 00:00:37.076
CAPSULE: Proposed uses stay separate from findings.

00:00:37.426 --> 00:00:38.504
TABLET: Read. Compare. Verify.

00:00:38.504 --> 00:00:41.022
TABLET: Open the Atlas, find your next paper,

00:00:41.022 --> 00:00:42.460
TABLET: and explore the method.
